[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Heracles Main Control Application FW Software Requirements Specification
UID: DHF-HRC-0013
METADATA:
  COMPONENT: main-control/main

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to provide Software Requirements Specifications for the Heracles Main Control
Application Firmware (FW).
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes all requirements of the Heracles Main Control Application FW.
The information in this document has been derived from the VoxelRay Heracles Product Requirements
Specification, as referenced in this document.

*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware systems.*
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| Abbreviation/Term | Definition                                  |
+===================+=============================================+
| FW                | Firmware                                    |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| HVPS              | High Voltage Power Supply                   |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| LED               | Light Emitting Diode                        |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| MCU               | Microcontroller Unit                        |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| PID               | Proportional Integral Derivative controller |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| PRS               | Product Requirements Specification          |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| SDP               | Software Development Plan                   |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| SRS               | Software Requirements Specification         |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
| SW                | Software                                    |
+-------------------+---------------------------------------------+
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The main control application firmware serves as the main logical control for system operation.

The main control application firmware monitors all the inputs from the various connections on the board
hardware. It can also be used to set and control many of the components that the main control board
interfaces with. For off the shelf components, the main control application can set/enable the motor controller drivers for cooling system pump and fans, and can enable the ion pump controller.

The main control application firmware runs on the main control MCU of the main control board.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: References

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
